        "id": "planning-unbounded-integer-domain",
        "severity": "blocking",
        "message": "C-HEX:REQ-002 includes the approved boundary that no undocumented maximum may be introduced, but the plan specifies neither a precision-safe conversion strategy nor a test for a positive integer beyond the JavaScript safe-integer boundary. The current src/App.jsx and src/App.test.jsx mapping therefore does not yet demonstrate mathematically equivalent conversion across the full supported domain.",
